# bolt

--- Rock_gadget | gadget | TID_ROCK_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Bolt gains a <VALUE1> - <VALUE2> health shield based on his current speed.
now  Bolt gains a <VALUE1> - <VALUE2> health shield based on his current speed.
